WEBVTT

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:24.041
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Are you free to go for a drink this evening?

00:00:25.219 --> 00:00:25.966
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Oh,

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.340
I… um…

00:00:29.894 --> 00:00:32.142
I’m sorry, I can’t.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.980
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> It’s nice to meet you.

00:00:45.072 --> 00:00:46.467
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> It’s nice to meet you, too.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.060
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> How’s the photography course going?

00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:01.299
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s great.

00:01:13.712 --> 00:01:15.660
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’ve heard a lot about you.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.140
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Me too.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.420
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Actually, I need to go now.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.699
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> But you just got here.